    "text": "@icreatelife 🪰🪰\n\nhttps://x.com/GlennHasABeard/status/2099212328080392329?s=20",
    "quoted_tweet": {
      "author": "Glenn Williams",
      "username": "GlennHasABeard",
      "text": "A fruit fly brain built a guitar.\n\nGoogle and Janelia released the full wiring of a fly brain last week. 166,700 neurons, 25 million connections. I loaded all of it, gave it eyes, and put a light in front of it. Wherever it walked, it laid a block. The light traced a guitar. The fly did the rest.\n\nThe wiring is real. The dynamics, the eyes, and the joystick are mine. Every loop in the trail is the fly losing the light and hunting for it. It finished in 18 seconds of brain time.\n\n12 years building guitars. This is the worst one I've ever made and I can't stop watching it.\n\nThis is round one. I'm going to keep refining it and see how far \"fly builds guitar\" can go."
    },
